WEBVTT

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:54.940
You sure start cleaning early.

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.350
If I don't do a little
at a time...

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:58.510
there's too much to
do at the end.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.920
You clean up every
single day.

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:05.560
I can't believe there's
anything left to clean.

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:08.760
Manager, any other stuff to burn?
The fire's dying out.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:11.760
This is the last of it.
Careful, it's heavy.

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:15.170
Mom, the yams are about done.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:16.370
Okay.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.970
Is it something of
deep significance?

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:56.640
Whatever you can find
out is fine.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.740
I need to identify it.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:03.310
I'll try too, but I thought
you could help me.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:07.820
Is it too much trouble?

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.530
Trouble?! Of course not!

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:16.260
It's just that, I'm not
sure I could find anything out.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:17.700
I want to...

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:20.620
I want to find out
anything I can.

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:23.910
Even if it turns out to
be just an ordinary rock.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:28.600
I don't think I could
do it myself.

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:31.840
You're the only person
I can ask, Godai.

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:35.810
Is it too much to ask?

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:39.340
I'll do it.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:42.550
You will?!

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:45.370
I'll do what I can.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.100
May I?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.410
Paleozoic.

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:08.070
Ordovician flavor.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:10.640
Y-You can tell?!

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.280
Don't be silly.

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.660
I just wanted to say that.

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:20.660
KINDAI BOOKSTORE

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:24.390
NATURAL SCIENCES

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:37.600
Found you!

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:39.910
Hi.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.870
Were you here all
this time?

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:44.780
I was waiting until now
at the comics section.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.120
What were you looking at?

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:51.510
Oh, nothing.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.090
Christmas is right around
the corner.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:00.820
Yeah.

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:06.870
Godai, are you short
of cash?

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:07.660
Huh?

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:10.910
Is that why we met today
at the bookstore?

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:14.340
No, it's not that. There was
something I wanted to look up.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:15.480
So that's it!

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:18.680
Oh!

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.390
They're lovely.

00:06:33.630 --> 00:06:34.920
But so expensive.

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:37.500
They're stones, too.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:41.410
Stones? No, I want that
one over there.

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:47.300
The cat design.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:53.310
I'm not asking for it...

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.480
as a Christmas present
or anything.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.920
You'll be joining us of course,
won't you, Godai?

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:14.410
For Godai, that depends on
the manager's answer.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:15.720
That's right.

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:19.330
My... So matter-of-fact.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.810
The manager already said
she'd be there.

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:24.510
Mr. Mitaka, too.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.010
The night is Christmas Eve.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:34.160
Passions rise to the tune
of Christmas carols.

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:38.720
The flames of romance
burn bright at Chachamaru!

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:42.660
You don't want to miss
that, do you, Godai?

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:43.930
Join us!

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.760
Okay! It's all set!

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.700
W-Wait...

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:49.800
What for?

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.370
How much will it cost?

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:08.250
The party fee, the manager's
present and Kozue.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:10.590
These, I've absolutely
got to cover.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.490
Any way I look at it,
I'm short of cash.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:38.080
Silly! If such a great job
existed, I'd do it myself.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.350
You'd actually work,
Sakamoto?!

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:45.030
Christmas through New Year's
costs money.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:46.930
It sure does.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:51.230
I promised my girl I'd
take her to Saipan.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:52.700
Saipan?!

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:58.730
There's only one way to make
quick money. Work two jobs.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:03.310
What's wrong, Godai?
Sore stomach?

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:04.680
I hate you!

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:05.410
Huh?

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:07.510
You make me sick!

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:27.830
Just one week!

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.310
I'm Galactic Warrior
Big Bang!

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:00.300
What the heck did you think
you were doing?!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.090
You're both fired!

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:44.970
Will this be a gift?

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:45.700
Yes.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:49.850
I'd like these wrapped
separately.

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:51.820
Would you like cards
for them?

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:52.780
No.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:55.250
What color ribbon shall
I use?

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:59.390
Green for the brooch and
red for the bracelet.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:09.510
Thank you for waiting.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.570
I'll take this, too.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:28.980
I'll save money by skipping the dryer.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.520
Manager!

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.570
Wait up! I'll be
right there!

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:45.600
You can?!

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:50.070
Sakamoto has a friend who
does geologic surveys.

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:52.980
If we take it to him
maybe we can find out.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.750
Don't get your hopes
too high, though.

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:58.850
I wouldn't know what to say
if we can't find out.

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:00.660
I'd never...

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:04.750
Either way, we'll know
before the party.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:07.750
I hope so.

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:22.410
Young Godai.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:27.120
Let's party, Godai.

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:30.180
The manager's wearing
a thong bikini!

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:37.450
I don't think he's
faking it.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:41.990
Looks like he wore himself
out working.

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:45.070
So much for our drinking party.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:48.430
Oh well, guess we'll have
to skip it today.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:51.670
How boring.
Makes me sad.

00:12:56.820 --> 00:13:00.220
In the name of love
He works himself to the bone

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:03.580
And sleeps like a log.
How cute...

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:06.950
So cute.

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:11.020
Cute, isn't he?
Too many syllables.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:39.290
See you!

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:40.850
Godai!

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:42.920
Yes?

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.420
Will you be going to the
Otonashi residence today?

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:49.690
Yes. It's my last tutoring
session this year.

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.790
I'll be there myself later.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:55.600
Then we'll see each
other there.

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:59.500
That's right. Don't forget
about the rock.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:02.780
I kept thinking about it
all last night.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:05.640
It'd really be nice if
we could find out.

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.820
I'm sorry. I didn't
mean to keep you.

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:11.520
Weren't you in a hurry?

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:14.020
That's all right.
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:21.170
Hi there, Godai!
A date with Kozue?

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:24.260
I'm going to see Sakamoto!

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:27.000
I see. THEN you're
going on a date!

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:28.010
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:32.980
See you later!
'Bye!

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.420
He's running away!

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:39.070
Chachamaru at seven.
Don't be late now!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:03.130
Doesn't look valuable
or anything.

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:05.740
It's probably just
an ordinary rock.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:10.080
Don't these rice-sized specks
suggest something significant?

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:11.470
You mean these?

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:13.620
I've got it!

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:15.380
R-Really?

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.790
This is a rice rock!

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:22.620
Dummy!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.370
I'll hold on to it.

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.460
Will you know by the
end of the day?

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:27.500
Let's see...

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.460
Meet me here at 6:30.

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:34.270
6:30? That'll give me
enough time.

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:36.430
Okay, see you then.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.180
Sakamoto!

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.120
Don't even think of losing,
breaking or even...

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:43.440
eating that rock!

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:44.370
No way!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:49.460
The night was Christmas Eve.

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:51.840
Under a sky filled with stars,

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.980
a large shooting star...

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:59.530
three wise men followed it from the east
towards Bethelem...

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:00.460
Kozue...

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:03.730
Merry Christmas.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.210
Merry Christmas to you, too.

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:20.140
COUPON GOOD FOR
ONE SWEATER

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:25.620
I did my best to knit it, but
I couldn't finish. Sorry.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.510
It'll be just a little longer.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:35.490
It's so cute!

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:36.820
Like it?

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:37.960
Very much.

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:06.760
Well, I've got to
get goIng.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.950
You'll be coming to tonight's
party, won't you, Coach?

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.530
Sorry. I already made
other plans.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.880
I'll be at the year-end
party, though.

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:16.700
It's Christmas Eve!
Who's your date?!

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:18.910
Wasn't it your turn
today, Yuko?

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:20.500
No, it's Tamiko's, right?

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:21.910
Huh? I thought it
was Hideyo's.

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:24.440
Come now, ladies.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:25.480
Who is it?

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:27.680
Someone you don't know.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.170
He's serious!

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:30.780
Lucky girl!

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:35.150
She doesn't realize it yet.
See you.

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:38.300
Then again...

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:46.570
TO MS. OTONASHI

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:49.970
That Mitaka doesn't miss
a thing.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.700
A bit too obvious, though.

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:53.740
Doesn't bother me.

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:02.480
Merry had a little lamb
named Christmas.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:04.280
You're early.

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:07.520
I quit work early
to come here.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.960
Do you really have a job?

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:12.430
That is a secret.

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:17.760
Akemi... A job for you.

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:20.380
Put this up outside.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:25.210
CLOSED TODAY
FOR PRIVATE PARTY

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:30.380
Hi Akemi!

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.710
You're both early.

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:36.950
We've been waiting anxiously
all afternoon.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.490
So we decided we may as well
wait at Chachamaru.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.420
Hi!

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:53.460
Will it snow tonight?

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:11.710
Did you find what you
were looking for?

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:17.890
There aren't many books
with pictures.

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:23.060
Strange how it is.

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:25.190
I'd almost forgotten
all about it...

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:28.530
but now it's all I can
think about.

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:32.670
Perhaps it would've been
better not to remember.

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:38.050
It's better to forget.

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:40.880
No. I couldn't do that.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.630
Okay, that's all for today.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:56.870
I'm done!

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:01.330
Ikuko, I have a reward
for you.

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:04.500
It's Christmas.

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:05.800
Here.

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:10.240
What is it?
Can I open it?

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:11.010
Sure.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.250
Thanks! I'll put it
on my school bag.

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:17.820
I had trouble choosing
what to get you.

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:25.370
I just remembered
something funny.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:26.130
Huh?

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:29.820
It's about a present
uncle gave to auntie.

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:31.960
That Soichiro gave?

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:32.960
Right.

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:35.130
It was a rock, about
so big...

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:37.830
with odd speckles.

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:46.680
I think that was the first and
last present he ever gave to her.

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:51.380
A rock is sure a weird gift,
even from a geology teacher!

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:55.420
Uh-huh...

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:19.850
I uh...

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:21.040
Yes?

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.540
About that rock.

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:25.630
Yes?

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:29.090
No, never mind.
Forget it.

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:49.140
Ms. Otonashi!

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:51.210
Oh...!

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:53.350
Going somewhere?

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:56.210
No car today, Coach Mitaka?

00:21:57.060 --> 00:21:58.890
Oh, I forgot. You'll
be drinking.

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:02.760
You're on your way to Chachamaru,
right? Let's go together.

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:05.490
Wait. Aren't you coming,
Godai?

00:22:06.730 --> 00:22:10.790
I'm going to pick up
the rock. Go on ahead.

00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:01.310
Missed my chance again.

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:03.750
Wow! Snow!

00:23:04.090 --> 00:23:06.050
It's snowing! It's snowing!

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:11.630
Look Mommy, snow!

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:12.660
Owwee!

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:15.200
--I'm so sorry.
--It's all right.

00:23:15.270 --> 00:23:17.930
Be more careful.
Apologize to the man.

00:23:23.240 --> 00:23:24.830
It looks more like
Christmas now.

00:23:49.420 --> 00:23:51.710
I had a slight mishap.

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:54.620
I'll be a little late
but I'll be there!

00:23:55.230 --> 00:23:57.060
Please let the manager know.

00:23:57.660 --> 00:24:02.180
Next: "Cruel to be Kind!
Thoughts of Love, at Christmas-Time"

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:05.430
I hate Christmas!
